{"book":"2-kings","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T08:40:34.761953395Z","verse":23,"ref":"2-kings 19:23","tier":"bulk","chapter":19,"translation":"By ⟨the⟩ hand of your messengers you ⟨have⟩ reproached ⟨the⟩ Adonai and said, 'By ⟨the⟩ multitude of my chariots I ⟨have⟩ ascended to ⟨the⟩ height of ⟨the⟩ mountains, to ⟨the⟩ sides of Lebanon, and I ⟨have⟩ cut down ⟨the⟩ height of its cedars, ⟨the⟩ choice of its firs, and I ⟨have⟩ entered into ⟨the⟩ lodging of its border, ⟨the⟩ forest of its Carmel.'","tokens":[{"surface":"ביד","gloss":"By"},{"surface":"מלאכיך","gloss":"your messengers"},{"surface":"חרפת","gloss":"you ⟨have⟩ reproached"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"⟨the⟩ Adonai"},{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"and said"},{"surface":"ברכב","gloss":"By"},{"surface":"רכבי","gloss":"⟨the⟩ multitude of my chariots"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"עליתי","gloss":"⟨have⟩ ascended"},{"surface":"מרום","gloss":"to ⟨the⟩ height"},{"surface":"הרים","gloss":"of ⟨the⟩ mountains"},{"surface":"ירכתי","gloss":"to ⟨the⟩ sides"},{"surface":"לבנון","gloss":"of Lebanon"},{"surface":"ואכרת","gloss":"and I ⟨have⟩ cut down"},{"surface":"קומת","gloss":"⟨the⟩ height"},{"surface":"ארזיו","gloss":"of its cedars"},{"surface":"מבחור","gloss":"⟨the⟩ choice"},{"surface":"ברשיו","gloss":"of its firs"},{"surface":"ואבואה","gloss":"and I ⟨have⟩ entered"},{"surface":"מלון","gloss":"into ⟨the⟩ lodging"},{"surface":"קצה","gloss":"of its border"},{"surface":"יער","gloss":"⟨the⟩ forest"},{"surface":"כרמלו","gloss":"of its Carmel"}]}